{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0084_1000_p", "source_sha256": "38b1825849cc4c1b0022f13cf5955bc7a918c2bb9a5946858b215f41b860ad1a", "ja": "（三姉妹カフェの撮影もいよいよ佳境に突入した。\nあともうひとふんばり、というところなんだが……）", "zh": "（《三姊妹咖啡厅》的拍摄也终于到了高潮部分。\n大家再加把劲就能杀青了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0084_1001_042miy", "source_sha256": "f0978e8d5f9c2460952457ca65c373119cd663d3558661d1d44d46b4bd784aef", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです～。\n30分休憩だそうですよ～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了～\n听说有30分钟可以休息喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0084_1002_p", "source_sha256": "e09457867dbde7872b6ad3a026cbea3a247c6578ca58a25a4ab9abfd2c7d7266", "ja": "お疲れさま、美也。\nちょっと疲れてるみたいだな。", "zh": "美也，辛苦了。\n你看起来好像有点累呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0084_1003_042miy", "source_sha256": "eef90cca5bf0ff6c03ffff1423b52e4c6c9b32a58a7d0b879a70c577ec7df2d3", "ja": "はい～。最後のシーンで、\nリテイクが続いてしまったので……む～ん。", "zh": "是啊～最后那个场景，\n已经重拍了好几遍……嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0084_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "bd57b6bd49d5c8186942b5107042cc8fd49ef43bdf96cabea098b034b13f66cc", "ja": "一夏さんと悠利さんをふたりきりにしようとする\nシーンが、どうしても上手くいかないんです～。", "zh": "要让一夏和悠利独处的那一幕，\n不管我怎么演就是演不好～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0084_1005_042miy", "source_sha256": "53396c4b302e7e31b1cadba5402c1314d5aaf0aa1fc476d8608355fbe9a3869f", "ja": "ミャオがいろいろ失敗して、シッポちゃんが\nうまくフォローしてくれるところなんですけど……。", "zh": "就是喵尾搞砸一堆事情，\n志尾帮忙挽救回来的地方……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0084_1006_p", "source_sha256": "6c97c293647b2e81aba2cd67746e8e50ccab416efbb7a1d1d2ef9769ec5572b9", "ja": "ああ……志保とふたり……いや、2匹か？\nとにかく、掛け合いのシーンだな。", "zh": "啊……是你跟志保两人……呃，该说两只吗？\n总之是和她一起拍摄的场景对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0084_1007_042miy", "source_sha256": "f8e22b99ab62883db943b5aef3e698b9610da94ecc37dd9c4a2d8ba51d736be1", "ja": "はい～。監督さんに、なんだか、テンポがよくないと\n言われてしまって……む～ん……。", "zh": "嗯～导演说我演的节奏不太好……\n嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0084_1008_042miy", "source_sha256": "312c8a550a12d1f8ce00a22c9abe2c8c5d7e1a0c1104ce83a8ace3517e8f34c8", "ja": "でも私、お芝居だってわかっていても、失敗すると\nなんだか気になってしまって～。", "zh": "我虽然明白这是在演戏，\n但心里还是很在意搞砸的事情～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0084_1009_042miy", "source_sha256": "6f0037d03c66eef5c8ae1f0f3b32f73eadd313acc1822ccecae57784a8024dba", "ja": "それで、つい振り返ったりしてしまうんです～。\n気にしないで進んで、って言われたんですけど……。", "zh": "所以就会不小心回头去看～\n虽然导演要我别在意，继续演下去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0084_1010_p", "source_sha256": "83397dc1d872dc80ce187730814195c951a23981b70f348bd81480b76b4113d8", "ja": "そうか……でも確かに、\nそれは気になっちゃうかもしれないな。", "zh": "这样啊……\n这确实是会很在意呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0084_1011_042miy", "source_sha256": "843c6b20af805591d7e505e78b31efbf6b820b337498c358379d6d6eb1a32813", "ja": "はい～。どうしたらいいんでしょう～……。", "zh": "对啊～我该怎么办才好～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0084_1012_p", "source_sha256": "61a189c467015f4037af94d3dc504102fdfd5c7bd390b090b050375469465224", "ja": "そうだな……まずは休憩して、気分を変えよう。\n美也、お茶でも飲むか？", "zh": "这个嘛……先休息一下，转换心情吧。\n美也，你要喝茶吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0084_1013_042miy", "source_sha256": "24a6354bb77e264ec0fd32546eaef88fdf2c68bc2ca13b7a9856bb0b35e447e2", "ja": "ありがとうございます～。\nでも、大丈夫ですよ～。", "zh": "谢谢你～\n我不用没关系～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0084_1014_042miy", "source_sha256": "0dcf2d98da8265949a9677e6f89031a17d903f6aa22cefbb0616bb3283f8f222", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\n猫はこういうとき、どうしているんでしょうか～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n你觉得猫咪在这种时候会做什么呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0084_1015_p", "source_sha256": "23e4db66d43a6f3eaa308788ef9828cb0f25d30afac0d1c5b3c3c7a835150528", "ja": "猫って、本物の猫のことか？", "zh": "你说的猫咪，是指真的猫吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0084_1016_042miy", "source_sha256": "0547024470d5752b4d234637cc13eb24a95694a52e414a0e80607fb1e765a93e", "ja": "はい～。それとも、本物の猫は、\n失敗なんてしないんでしょうか～？", "zh": "嗯～还是你觉得，\n真正的猫是不会犯错的～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0084_1017_p", "source_sha256": "411e91e47655c34274de6d5cde80ff8f8fbf14c5dbf920ee4124337686979836", "ja": "そうだな……でも、猫だって\n失敗することくらいあるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "或许吧……不过，\n我想猫也是会搞砸一两件事情的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0084_1018_p", "source_sha256": "ffe194e9b6fdbd291dae3906d1da65fadcd5c843f7dc7ea331dabdefbc728b2d", "ja": "ただ、それを人間には見せないように\nしているだけだと思うけど……。", "zh": "只是牠们不会让人类看见而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0084_1019_042miy", "source_sha256": "87d3a5ecbd84dbfd8b4f5ab2183538d194059fa10323617c2ec7aceebca6d908", "ja": "人間には見せないように……ですか～？", "zh": "不让人类看见……是这样吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0084_1020_p", "source_sha256": "70c4ff6d4ff5f4efaee79cdbeaedb19fbbdb0fbf3614a191fae607b7d7040265", "ja": "うん。猫同士とか、飼い主とか……信用している\n相手にだったら、普通に見せてるのかもしれないな。", "zh": "嗯，但如果是猫跟猫之间，或是跟饲主……\n面对自己信任的对象，应该还是会展现出这样的一面吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0084_1021_042miy", "source_sha256": "71b9f51be121b7d2737aabc3ee5be2da9f1d4a8df40b5e8dd7652fb8b58ca2f4", "ja": "信用している相手、ですか……。", "zh": "自己信任的对象啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0084_1022_042miy", "source_sha256": "c81ed67c425544086b229bc222fa2ca83c0836cc51992776e402d246cdf52e06", "ja": "{$P$}さん、ありがとうございます。\n私、なんとなくわかりましたよ～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，谢谢你。\n我好像明白了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0084_1023_p", "source_sha256": "1fcf8a2cd2a8e7f7b47ee2a16061b31e3436960324efaf3c4e12492097d73636", "ja": "え？　わかった？", "zh": "咦？你明白了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0084_1024_042miy", "source_sha256": "744dd3637894b638fc81c7dd2c57c883aa0b823a6d7a5f83584630eab474c82f", "ja": "はい～。猫のミャオが、失敗しても、\nどんどん進んでいける理由です～。", "zh": "嗯～我明白猫咪喵尾即使失败\n还是能不停往前迈进的理由了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0084_1025_042miy", "source_sha256": "1dd74706228d3f76f273ad3a01aa2c8717b4f57ec247c9e0c2bb8c0ad707ee5c", "ja": "ミャオは、シッポちゃんを信用してるんですね～。\nだから、どんどん進んでいけるのかもしれません～。", "zh": "因为喵尾，非常信任志尾～\n这或许就是牠能一直往前迈进的原因～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0084_1026_p", "source_sha256": "62648ac8b6c01c09a44adb76617e1dc5e632821dc558f06dff5b0ea1efed69ab", "ja": "ああ……確かに、そうかもしれない。\n2匹は仲良しって設定だもんな。", "zh": "嗯……也对，或许就是如此。\n毕竟牠们俩在设定上是好朋友嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0084_1027_042miy", "source_sha256": "62f2dfc5061ecf82327f1a24cf3dca3107d8f9a625d7c0f2044e996f0d259aff", "ja": "なので私、次は、どんどん進むことにします～。\n志保ちゃん……いえ、シッポちゃんを信じますよ～。", "zh": "所以我决定，下次要一直线前进～\n我要相信志保……不对，相信志尾～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0084_1028_p", "source_sha256": "9f1a6389927d49209b7c8ae1ca694eb6da17a9e7eeb31c111654c5c33da90ebb", "ja": "（上手く気持ちが切り替えられたのか、休憩後の撮影は\nあっという間にOKが出た。やったな、美也！）", "zh": "（也许是成功转换了心情，休息结束之后的拍摄\n一下子就获得认可，太好了，美也！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
